## Why This Is Asked
Realistic scenarios require extensible telemetry without destabilizing hot paths. This question probes design of registries, non-blocking execution, and per-request composition.

## Key Concepts
- Strategy/Factory for pluggable collectors
- Runtime registry with lazy instantiation
- Per-request composition and non-blocking execution
- Telemetry sink integration and safety guarantees

## Code Example
```javascript
interface ICollector {
  start(): void;
  stop(): void;
  emit(event: any): void;
}
class Registry {
  private map = new Map<string, () => ICollector>();
  register(name: string, factory: () => ICollector) { this.map.set(name, factory); }
  create(name: string): ICollector { return this.map.get(name)!.call(null); }
}
```

